    {
      "occurrence": 33,
      "number": 200,
      "number_raw": "200",
      "source_number": "200",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Your metabolic rate is twice normal.  This means that you are much less resistant to radiation and poison, but your body heals faster.",
      "source_text": "Your metabolic rate is twice normal.  This means that you are much less resistant to radiation and poison, but your body heals faster.",
      "source_line_start": 42,
      "source_line_end": 42,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 34,
      "number": 201,
      "number_raw": "201",
      "source_number": "201",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "A little slower, but a little bigger.  You may not hit as often, but they will feel it when you do!  Your total action points are lowered, but your Strength is increased.",
      "source_text": "A little slower, but a little bigger.  You may not hit as often, but they will feel it when you do!  Your total action points are lowered, but your Strength is increased.",
      "source_line_start": 43,
      "source_line_end": 43,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 35,
      "number": 202,
      "number_raw": "202",
      "source_number": "202",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You are not quite as big as the other Vault-Dwellers, but that never slowed you down.  You can't carry as much, but you are more agile.",
      "source_text": "You are not quite as big as the other Vault-Dwellers, but that never slowed you down.  You can't carry as much, but you are more agile.",
      "source_line_start": 44,
      "source_line_end": 44,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 36,
      "number": 203,
      "number_raw": "203",
      "source_number": "203",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "One of your hands is very dominant.  You excel with single-handed weapons, but two-handed weapons cause a problem.",
      "source_text": "One of your hands is very dominant.  You excel with single-handed weapons, but two-handed weapons cause a problem.",
      "source_line_start": 45,
      "source_line_end": 45,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 37,
      "number": 204,
      "number_raw": "204",
      "source_number": "204",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Your attacks show a lot of finesse.  You don't do as much damage, but you cause more critical hits.",
      "source_text": "Your attacks show a lot of finesse.  You don't do as much damage, but you cause more critical hits.",
      "source_line_start": 46,
      "source_line_end": 46,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 38,
      "number": 205,
      "number_raw": "205",
      "source_number": "205",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "By not paying attention to any threats, you can act a lot faster in a turn.  This lowers your armor class to just what you are wearing, but you sequence much faster in a combat turn.",
      "source_text": "By not paying attention to any threats, you can act a lot faster in a turn.  This lowers your armor class to just what you are wearing, but you sequence much faster in a combat turn.",
      "source_line_start": 47,
      "source_line_end": 47,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 39,
      "number": 206,
      "number_raw": "206",
      "source_number": "206",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You swing harder, not better.  Your attacks are very brutal, but lack finesse.  You rarely cause a good critical, but you always do more melee damage.",
      "source_text": "You swing harder, not better.  Your attacks are very brutal, but lack finesse.  You rarely cause a good critical, but you always do more melee damage.",
      "source_line_start": 48,
      "source_line_end": 48,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 40,
      "number": 207,
      "number_raw": "207",
      "source_number": "207",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You don't have time to aim for a targeted attack, because you attack faster than normal people.  It costs you one less action point to use a weapon.",
      "source_text": "You don't have time to aim for a targeted attack, because you attack faster than normal people.  It costs you one less action point to use a weapon.",
      "source_line_start": 49,
      "source_line_end": 49,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 41,
      "number": 208,
      "number_raw": "208",
      "source_number": "208",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "By some strange twist of fate, people around you die violently.  You always see the worst way a person can die.",
      "source_text": "By some strange twist of fate, people around you die violently.  You always see the worst way a person can die.",
      "source_line_start": 50,
      "source_line_end": 50,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 42,
      "number": 209,
      "number_raw": "209",
      "source_number": "209",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The good thing is that everyone around you has more critical failures in combat, the bad thing is so do you!",
      "source_text": "The good thing is that everyone around you has more critical failures in combat, the bad thing is so do you!",
      "source_line_start": 51,
      "source_line_end": 51,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 43,
      "number": 210,
      "number_raw": "210",
      "source_number": "210",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You studied less-combative skills as you were growing up.  Your combat skills start at a lower level, but First Aid, Doctor, Speech and Barter are substantially improved.",
      "source_text": "You studied less-combative skills as you were growing up.  Your combat skills start at a lower level, but First Aid, Doctor, Speech and Barter are substantially improved.",
      "source_line_start": 52,
      "source_line_end": 52,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 44,
      "number": 211,
      "number_raw": "211",
      "source_number": "211",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You are more easily addicted to chems.  Your chance to be addicted by chem use is twice normal, but you recover faster from their ill effects.",
      "source_text": "You are more easily addicted to chems.  Your chance to be addicted by chem use is twice normal, but you recover faster from their ill effects.",
      "source_line_start": 53,
      "source_line_end": 53,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 45,
      "number": 212,
      "number_raw": "212",
      "source_number": "212",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Chems only affect you half as long as normal, but your chance to be addicted is also only 50% of normal.",
      "source_text": "Chems only affect you half as long as normal, but your chance to be addicted is also only 50% of normal.",
      "source_line_start": 54,
      "source_line_end": 54,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 46,
      "number": 213,
      "number_raw": "213",
      "source_number": "213",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "As a night-time person, you are more awake when the sun goes down.  Your Intelligence and Perception are improved at night, but dulled during the day.",
      "source_text": "As a night-time person, you are more awake when the sun goes down.  Your Intelligence and Perception are improved at night, but dulled during the day.",
      "source_line_start": 55,
      "source_line_end": 55,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 47,
      "number": 214,
      "number_raw": "214",
      "source_number": "214",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Since you spent more time improving your skills than a normal person, you start with better skill levels.  The tradeoff is that you do not gain as many extra abilities.  You will gain a perk every four levels.",
